@@ -3,3 +3,12 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (from `src/index.ts`) returns an in-memory service with `addEquipment`, `quote`
+and `book`. Rules it enforces: money is integer euro cents; times are ISO-8601 UTC strings; a period
+runs from a midnight UTC to a later midnight UTC (end exclusive), priced as whole days times the daily
+price; the same item cannot be booked for overlapping periods. Booking ids are sequential
+(`booking-1`, ...) so results are deterministic. Cancellation (24-hour no-refund policy) is not
+implemented yet. Run the tests with `npm test`.
